WEBVTT

00:00:28.913 --> 00:00:33.121
a portable device that can instantly
translate between any languages.

00:00:33.871 --> 00:00:36.954
So is a universal translator
possible in real life?

00:00:36.996 --> 00:00:40.621
We already have many programs
that claim to do just that,

00:00:40.662 --> 00:00:44.079
taking a word, sentence,
or entire book in one language

00:00:44.121 --> 00:00:46.954
and translating it into almost any other,

00:00:46.996 --> 00:00:51.787
whether it's modern English
or Ancient Sanskrit.

00:00:52.329 --> 00:00:55.871
And if translation were just a matter
of looking up words in a dictionary,

00:00:55.912 --> 00:00:58.162
these programs would 
run circles around humans.

00:00:58.204 --> 00:01:02.121
The reality, however,
is a bit more complicated.